# Copy to deploy/.env and fill in the password. deploy/.env is gitignored;
# the real credentials must never be committed.
#
# The FTP account is created in cPanel (Files -> FTP Accounts) and is scoped to
# the domain's document root. deploy/ftp-deploy.py connects with explicit TLS.
